we can remove direct relationship from Main class to these 4 classes
by creating a middle classes like "NotificationService"

this middle class act like an Interface,
he know how to send notifications
but just him has relationship to these 4 classes
so when we want to modify something,
we just need to modify this class and those 4 classes
the other classes don't need modification

summary: FACADE class is a class that ENCAPSULATE
         some other classes based on specific
         purpose or functionality.


